    {
      "name": "I1-text-edited-while-the-id-was-kept",
      "note": "the real-world shape of an invented id: the producer rewrote the text inside the 8-code-point prefix and left block_id and the derived fields alone. NOTE WHICH RULES FIRE. R29 does NOT, and that is correct: DESIGN.md 29 defines content_hash as the digest of text_normalised, and text_normalised is also stale, so the two agree with each other while both disagree with text. R28 is what catches that pair, and I1 catches the id. A validator that only checked 29 would pass this document.",
      "ops": [
        { "set": "blocks/4/text", "value": "Fig. 2. Residual learning: a building block." }
      ],
      "expect": [
